ut  in case you've been living under a rock  this past decade she starred as arya  stark in the hbo fantasy series game of  thrones  williams's life was pretty much consumed  by game of thrones from the moment it  became a hit  with her mother choosing to pull her out  of school to concentrate on acting  full-time  but she still found time to work on  other projects during its eight season  run  she appeared in british shows like the  secret of prickly hall and doctor who  and she began making her mark in feature  films with lead roles in period mystery  piece  the falling in 2014 sci-fi thriller eye  boy in 2017  and adventure comedy then came you in  2018.  like his new mutants co-star maisie  williams charlie heaton rose to  prominence after landing a part in a tv  show that quickly blew up  he's portrayed jonathan byers on netflix  hit stranger things since the show's  first season though  unlike williams he had a number of  credits to his name prior to his big  breakthrough  he cut his teeth on british tv dramas  dci banks vera and casualty before  making the move to feature films in 2015  playing a drug dealer in the gangster  flick rise of the foot soldier part 2.  after a few more small roles in indie  films the yorkshire native was off to  hollywood  he had to rough it a little to begin  with but before long heaton was walking  red carpets  he told gq i had this crazy trajectory  i went from literally living in a hostel  in la at the beginning of 2015 to  shooting stranger things at the end of  2015.  i had this turbulent crazy year and then  the show came out in 2016.  he appeared alongside naomi watts and  psychological thriller shut-in that same  year  and in 2017 he filmed his scenes as  marvel mutant samuel guthrie  aka cannonball blue hunt wasn't very  well known when she landed the part of  mutant danielle moonstar  aka mirage but she wasn't exactly  plucked from obscurity either  han to his of lakota ancestry began  working on a web series when she 