re making the transition to  hollywood in the mid-2000s she became  known to wider audiences in 2007 when  she worked alongside will smith and i am  legend  playing the survivor who takes a cure  from the star before he blows himself  and a bunch of terribly rendered zombies  to pieces since then braga has split her  time between the states and brazil where  she has her own production company  she's never stopped acting however and  chances are you've seen her do her thing  on numerous occasions over the past  decade  even if he didn't know it in 2010 she  starred opposite jude law enforced  whitaker and action thriller repo men  and that same year she joined an  ensemble cast that included adrian brody  and lawrence fishburne for predators  an attempted revival of the sci-fi  franchise other notable credits include  the matt damon sci-fi thriller elysium  in 2013  and the simon pegg comedy kill me three  times the year after  since 2016 she starred on the hit show  queen of the south as theresa mendoza a  downtrodden mexican woman who builds a  drug empire  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

